     2372         return-value skip
     2373         error-status:get-message(1) skip
     2374         error-status:get-message(2) skip
     2375         error-status:get-message(3) skip
     2376         view-as alert-box error .
     2377       undo, return error .
     2378     end.
     2379     for each bf_tt-allsum on error undo, return error return-value :
     2380       find first bf_tt-allsum-line where bf_tt-allsum-line.sum-type = bf_tt-allsum.sum-type no-error.
     2381       if not available bf_tt-allsum-line then do:
